---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<Layout title="About Rayenna Energy | MNRE-Approved Solar Installer in Kochi, Kerala" description="Rayenna Energy is an MNRE-empanelled solar company based in Vyttila, Kochi. Our certified team installs domestic and commercial solar systems across Kerala with full PM Surya Ghar subsidy assistance.">

  <!-- ===== PAGE HERO ===== -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <img src={`${base}/media/hero-copy.jpg`} alt="Rayenna Energy solar installation" class="page-hero__bg" />
    <div class="page-hero__overlay"></div>
    <div class="container page-hero__inner">
      <p class="page-hero__eyebrow">The Responsible Energy Company</p>
      <h1 class="page-hero__title">Kerala's Trusted<br />Solar Energy Company</h1>
      <p class="page-hero__sub">Transforming the way Kerala harnesses energy — one rooftop at a time.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== WHO WE ARE ===== -->
  <section class="intro-section">
    <div class="container intro-section__inner">
      <div class="intro-section__image">
        <img src={`${base}/media/Solar-Kochi-workers.jpg`} alt="Rayenna installation team at work" />
      </div>
      <div class="intro-section__content">
        <span class="section-tag">Who We Are</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Innovating Solar Energy for a Greener Tomorrow</h2>
        <p>Rayenna Energy is a leading provider of innovative solar energy solutions dedicated to transforming the way you harness and use energy. With a deep commitment to delivering high-quality solar installations that prioritise sustainability, efficiency, and affordability, we believe in creating a greener future.</p>
        <p>Going solar is about more than simply saving money on electricity bills; it's about making the earth a better place for future generations. The knowledge and experience of our leadership team are not only a benefit to Rayenna Energy but also the cornerstone upon which we establish our standing as a reliable supplier of solar energy solutions.</p>
        <div class="intro-badges">
          <div class="intro-badge">
            <strong>MNRE</strong>
            <span>Approved Channel Partner</span>
          </div>
          <div class="intro-badge">
            <strong>Govt. of India</strong>
            <span>Certified</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== OUR MISSION ===== -->
  <section class="mission-section">
    <div class="container mission-section__inner">
      <div class="mission-section__content">
        <span class="section-tag">Our Mission</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Making Solar Reliable, Affordable, and Accessible for All</h2>
        <p>Our goal is simple — make solar energy reliable and affordable for every customer in Kerala, without a single compromise. We listen to what each customer actually needs and build solutions around that. Sustainability isn't something we keep an eye on. It's the foundation everything is built on.</p>
        <p>Every installation we deliver is a commitment — to quality materials, transparent communication, and support that doesn't end when the panels go up. Our job isn't done when the system is installed. It's done when you're satisfied.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mission-pillars">
        {[
          { icon: '⚡', title: 'Quality First', text: 'Only the best-grade components make it into a Rayenna installation.' },
          { icon: '🌿', title: 'Sustainability', text: 'Every system we deploy reduces your carbon footprint measurably.' },
          { icon: '🔍', title: 'Transparency', text: 'Clear communication and real-time monitoring at every step.' },
          { icon: '🤝', title: 'Customer First', text: 'Your satisfaction drives every decision we make.' },
        ].map(p => (
          <div class="mission-pillar">
            <div class="mission-pillar__icon">{p.icon}</div>
            <h3>{p.title}</h3>
            <p>{p.text}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== LEADERSHIP ===== -->
  <section class="leadership-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="leadership-header">
        <span class="section-tag">Our Founders</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Expertise of Leadership</h2>
        <p class="leadership-intro">Our leadership is Rayenna's greatest asset. With decades of combined expertise spanning maritime, energy, and enterprise, our co-founders bring unmatched depth to every decision. Complementary in background, aligned in purpose — they are the bedrock on which Rayenna was built.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="leaders-grid">
        <article class="leader-card">
          <figure class="leader-card__photo leader-card__photo--ganesh">
            <img
              src={`${base}/Ganesh_V2.png`}
              alt="Ganesh Venkitachalam, Managing Director and Co-Founder of Rayenna Energy"
              width="1024"
              height="1024"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </figure>
          <div class="leader-card__body">
            <div class="leader-card__identity">
              <h3 class="leader-card__name">Ganesh Venkitachalam</h3>
              <span class="leader-role">Managing Director &amp; Co-Founder</span>
            </div>
            <p class="leader-card__bio">Ganesh began his career as a project engineer at Thermax, specialising in HVAC systems, before transitioning to the Merchant Navy. With 23 years of sailing experience, he developed invaluable leadership skills as a Master, earning accolades as a Best Master — a testament to his unwavering commitment to excellence.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="leader-card">
          <figure class="leader-card__photo leader-card__photo--arun">
            <img
              src={`${base}/Arun%20Balakrishnan.png`}
              alt="Capt. Arun Balakrishnan, Director and Co-Founder of Rayenna Energy"
              width="896"
              height="1171"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </figure>
          <div class="leader-card__body">
            <div class="leader-card__identity">
              <h3 class="leader-card__name">Capt. Arun Balakrishnan</h3>
              <span class="leader-role">Director &amp; Co-Founder</span>
            </div>
            <p class="leader-card__bio">A Government of India–certified Master Mariner with 100+ months of command on bulk carriers across global waters, Arun brings rare operational precision and maritime expertise. His deep knowledge of global shipping makes him an invaluable navigator for the company's logistics strategy.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== THE SKILLED HANDS ===== -->
  <section class="skilled-section">
    <div class="container skilled-section__inner">
      <div class="skilled-section__content">
        <span class="section-tag">Our Team</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">The Skilled Hands Behind Every Installation</h2>
        <p>A great solar system isn't just about the panels. It's about the people who install them. Rayenna's engineers, technicians, and customer service team work with a single purpose — to change someone's life with every installation. That belief is what drives us forward.</p>
        <p>Our team stays consistently ahead of the industry — through continuous technical training, hands-on experience, and a genuine hunger to keep getting better. The result? Every Rayenna installation reflects the highest standards in the industry. Not because we have to meet them. Because our people wouldn't have it any other way.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="skilled-section__image">
        <img src={`${base}/media/Drilling-solar.webp`} alt="Rayenna engineers installing solar panels" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== OUR PROMISE ===== -->
  <section class="promise-section">
    <div class="container promise-section__inner">
      <div class="promise-section__image">
        <img src={`${base}/media/Plan-solar.webp`} alt="Rayenna solar planning" />
      </div>
      <div class="promise-section__content">
        <span class="section-tag">Our Promise</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Our Promise to You</h2>
        <p>A promise only means something when it's kept. At Rayenna, ours comes down to three things — quality that doesn't cut corners, transparency at every stage, and a genuine responsibility to the environment. Not as policies on a wall. As the way we actually work.</p>
        <p>When you switch to solar with Rayenna, you're not just buying a system. You're getting a team that stays with you — through the installation, through the first bill, and long after. We source only the best materials, build systems that last, and treat every home and business we work with as if it were our own. Your satisfaction isn't a metric we track. It's the reason we show up.</p>
        <div class="promise-cta">
          <a href={`${base}/contact`} class="btn btn-primary">Get in Touch</a>
          <a href={`${base}/services`} class="btn btn-outline">Our Services</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
/* ===========================
   About Page — Mobile First
   =========================== */

/* ===== PAGE HERO ===== */
.page-hero {
  position: relative;
  min-height: 420px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
  overflow: hidden;
  padding-bottom: 56px;
}
.page-hero__bg {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  object-position: center 30%;
  z-index: 0;
}
.page-hero__overlay {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(
    to top,
    rgba(10, 25, 50, 0.88) 0%,
    rgba(10, 25, 50, 0.55) 50%,
    rgba(10, 25, 50, 0.25) 100%
  );
  z-index: 1;
}
.page-hero__inner {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
  padding-top: 88px;
}
.page-hero__eyebrow {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 2.5px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.page-hero__title {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 3.6rem);
  font-weight: 500;
  color: #ffffff;
  line-height: 1.15;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.page-hero__sub {
  font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 2vw, 1.1rem);
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
  max-width: 480px;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

/* ===== WHO WE ARE ===== */
.intro-section {
  padding: var(--section-padding);
  background: #ffffff;
}
.intro-section__inner {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  gap: 48px;
  align-items: center;
}
.intro-section__image {
  position: relative;
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
}
.intro-section__image img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 400px;
  object-fit: cover;
  object-position: center;
  display: block;
}
.intro-section__content p {
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  line-height: 1.9;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.intro-section__content .section-title { margin-bottom: 20px; }
.intro-badges {
  display: flex;
  gap: 16px;
  margin-top: 28px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.intro-badge {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  background: var(--color-light);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--color-primary);
  padding: 12px 18px;
  border-radius: 0 var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-sm) 0;
}
.intro-badge strong {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  color: var(--color-navy);
}
.intro-badge span {
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  margin-top: 2px;
}

/* ===== MISSION ===== */
.mission-section {
  padding: var(--section-padding);
  background: var(--color-light);
}
.mission-section__inner {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  gap: 48px;
  align-items: start;
  min-width: 0;
}
.mission-section__content p {
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  line-height: 1.9;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.mission-section__content .section-title { margin-bottom: 20px; }
.mission-pillars {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 12px;
  width: 100%;
  min-width: 0;
}
.mission-pillar {
  background: #ffffff;
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  padding: 18px 14px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  min-width: 0;
}
.mission-pillar__icon {
  font-size: 1.6rem;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.mission-pillar h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 0.88rem;
  color: var(--color-navy);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  line-height: 1.35;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}
.mission-pillar p {
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  line-height: 1.65;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

/* ===== LEADERSHIP ===== */
.leadership-section {
  position: relative;
  padding: var(--section-padding);
  background: var(--color-navy-dark);
  overflow: hidden;
}
.leadership-section::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse 90% 55% at 50% -10%, rgba(168, 56, 56, 0.14) 0%, transparent 55%),
    linear-gradient(165deg, #151c2e 0%, var(--color-navy) 48%, #2e3a5c 100%);
  pointer-events: none;
}
.leadership-section > .container {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}
.leadership-header {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 40px;
}
.leadership-header .section-tag {
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
}
.leadership-header .section-title {
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  color: #ffffff;
}
.leadership-intro {
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
  line-height: 1.85;
  max-width: 640px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  font-size: 0.98rem;
}

/* Mobile-first: stacked portrait cards */
.leaders-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  gap: 28px;
  max-width: 420px;
  margin-inline: auto;
}
.leader-card {
  margin: 0;
  background: #ffffff;
  border-radius: 20px;
  box-shadow:
    0 18px 48px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28),
    0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
  overflow: hidden;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  transition: transform var(--transition), box-shadow var(--transition);
}
.leader-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
  box-shadow:
    0 24px 56px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.32),
    0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14);
}

/* Unified 4:5 portrait crop — no mismatched letterboxing */
.leader-card__photo {
  margin: 0;
  width: 100%;
  aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
  overflow: hidden;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  position: relative;
  background: #1a2238;
}
.leader-card__photo img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  object-position: center 14%;
  display: block;
  transition: transform 0.5s ease;
}
.leader-card__photo--ganesh img {
  object-position: center 12%;
}
.leader-card__photo--arun img {
  object-position: center 16%;
}
.leader-card:hover .leader-card__photo img {
  transform: scale(1.04);
}

/* Subtle vignette so photo edges blend into the card */
.leader-card__photo::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(
    to bottom,
    transparent 72%,
    rgba(26, 34, 56, 0.18) 100%
  );
  pointer-events: none;
}

.leader-card__body {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  padding: 22px 20px 24px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}
.leader-card__identity {
  margin-bottom: 14px;
  padding-bottom: 14px;
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-primary-light);
}
.leader-card__name {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 1.12rem;
  color: var(--color-navy);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  line-height: 1.3;
}
.leader-role {
  display: inline-block;
  font-size: 0.68rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 1.1px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--color-primary);
  background: var(--color-primary-light);
  padding: 5px 10px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  line-height: 1.4;
}
.leader-card__bio {
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  line-height: 1.8;
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  margin: 0;
}

/* ===== SKILLED HANDS ===== */
.skilled-section {
  padding: var(--section-padding);
  background: var(--color-light);
}
.skilled-section__inner {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  gap: 40px;
  align-items: center;
}
.skilled-section__image img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 380px;
  object-fit: cover;
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  display: block;
}
.skilled-section__content .section-title { margin-bottom: 20px; }
.skilled-section__content p {
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  line-height: 1.9;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}

/* ===== OUR PROMISE ===== */
.promise-section {
  padding: var(--section-padding);
  background: #ffffff;
}
.promise-section__inner {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  gap: 40px;
  align-items: center;
}
.promise-section__image img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 380px;
  object-fit: cover;
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  display: block;
}
.promise-section__content .section-title { margin-bottom: 20px; }
.promise-section__content p {
  color: var(--color-text-muted);
  line-height: 1.9;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.promise-cta {
  display: flex;
  gap: 16px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin-top: 32px;
}

/* ===========================
   Breakpoints — tablet+
   =========================== */
@media (min-width: 640px) {
  .mission-pillars {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .mission-pillar { padding: 24px 20px; }
  .mission-pillar h3 { font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .mission-pillar p { font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .leaders-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    max-width: 720px;
  }
}

@media (min-width: 900px) {
  .intro-section__inner {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 72px;
  }
  .intro-section__image img { height: 480px; }

  .mission-section__inner {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 72px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .leaders-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 32px;
    align-items: stretch;
    max-width: 960px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  .leadership-header { margin-bottom: 52px; }
  .leader-card__body { padding: 24px 22px 28px; }
  .leader-card__name { font-size: 1.18rem; }
  .leader-card__bio { font-size: 0.9rem; }

  .skilled-section__inner {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 72px;
  }
  .skilled-section__image { order: 1; }

  .promise-section__inner {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 72px;
  }
}
</style>
